"settings.section.privacy": "PRIVACY",
"settings.privacy.open": "PRIVACY AND LICENSES",
"privacy.title": "PRIVACY",
"privacy.summary.1": "NO ACCOUNT REQUIRED",
"privacy.summary.2": "NO ADS",
"privacy.summary.3": "NO ANALYTICS",
"privacy.summary.4": "NO PERSONAL DATA COLLECTION BY THE GAME",
"privacy.summary.5": "SAVE DATA STAYS ON THIS DEVICE/BROWSER",
"privacy.read_full": "READ FULL PRIVACY POLICY",
"privacy.licenses": "LICENSES",
"privacy.policy.intro": "Catch and Brawl is designed to be played without creating an account and without sending gameplay data to the developer.",
"privacy.policy.collection.title": "Data collection",
"privacy.policy.collection.body": "The game does not collect, sell, or share personal information. It does not use advertising SDKs, analytics SDKs, tracking SDKs, location services, camera access, microphone access, contacts, or social login.",
"privacy.policy.local.title": "Local save data",
"privacy.policy.local.body": "Game progress, settings, records, Fish Book progress, and story progress are stored locally on your device or, for the web version, in browser storage. This information is not transmitted by the game to a developer server.",
"privacy.policy.web.title": "Web version",
"privacy.policy.web.body": "The web version is hosted by a third-party distribution platform. That platform may process technical information under its own privacy policy when delivering the game files. Catch and Brawl does not add its own analytics, advertising, or tracking system.",
"privacy.policy.export.title": "Save export and import",
"privacy.policy.export.body": "If the web build provides manual save export, the save file is created only when you request it. Import reads the file you choose locally in order to restore game progress.",
"privacy.policy.children.title": "Children and personal information",
"privacy.policy.children.body": "The game does not ask players to provide personal information and does not provide chat, user-generated content, or account features.",
"privacy.policy.changes.title": "Changes to this policy",
"privacy.policy.changes.body": "If a future version adds any feature that changes how data is handled, this policy will be updated before that version is released.",
"privacy.policy.contact.title": "Contact",
"privacy.policy.contact.body": "For privacy or support questions, contact: [PUBLISHER SUPPORT EMAIL]",
"privacy.licenses.intro": "Made with the Godot Engine. Godot is free and open source software under the MIT license:",
"privacy.licenses.components": "Godot includes third-party components under their own licenses: {list}.",
"privacy.licenses.fonts": "Text is set in Fredoka by Milena Brandão and Hafontia (Copyright 2016 The Fredoka Project Authors), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and Chewy by Font Diner (Copyright (c) 2010 by Font Diner, Inc DBA Sideshow), under the Apache License 2.0. Both licenses follow in full:",
"settings.web_storage_note": "This web version keeps your save in this browser's storage. Clearing site data or browser storage deletes it.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.land.1": "Excuse me. Fishing permit?",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.land.2": "This section of river is under my supervision.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.land.3": "Please step back from the water. Procedure.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.land.4": "I'll need you to come with me. Into a fight.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.player_win.1": "Noted. I will file a report against myself.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.player_win.2": "You may pass. Into the bucket, apparently.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.player_win.3": "Shift over. Somebody cover the bridge.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.player_win.4": "Good technique. Still no permit.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.fish_win.1": "Area secured.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.fish_win.2": "Please return during visiting hours.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.fish_win.3": "This is a restricted bucket zone.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.fish_win.4": "Thank you for your cooperation.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.reel_escape.1": "Unauthorized tension detected!",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.reel_escape.2": "Line confiscated.",
"dialogue.baung_satpam.reel_escape.3": "Evacuating to the deep end!",
"fish.baung_satpam.subtitle": "BRIDGE SECURITY",
"fish.baung_satpam.description": "Guards the old bridge with a whistle he cannot actually blow. Asks everyone for a permit. Has never issued one.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.land.1": "Oh! You're the man who sold the cooker!",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.land.2": "Wait till the whole river hears about this.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.land.3": "Psst. I know things. Fight me and I'll forget them.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.land.4": "Everyone's talking about you. Mostly me.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.player_win.1": "Fine. But I'm telling everyone you cheated.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.player_win.2": "This never happened. I'll tell them it did.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.player_win.3": "Ooh, the bucket. The gossip in there is excellent.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.player_win.4": "Good fight. Terrible haircut.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.fish_win.1": "Wait till Bu Yati hears.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.fish_win.2": "Losing to a tawes. That's going around.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.fish_win.3": "I have a source who says you'll lose again.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.fish_win.4": "Byeee. Don't worry, I'll tell everyone.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.reel_escape.1": "Breaking news: line snapped!",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.reel_escape.2": "Tell your wife I said hi.",
"dialogue.tawes_gosip.reel_escape.3": "That's going in the group chat.",
"fish.tawes_gosip.subtitle": "NEIGHBORHOOD NEWS",
"fish.tawes_gosip.description": "Knows who owes who, who sold the cooker, and who is fishing instead of working. Most of it is even true.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.land.1": "Excuse me, coming through.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.land.2": "Sorry, sorry, I'll be gone in a moment.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.land.3": "I'm very sorry about what happens next.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.land.4": "Pardon me. Slippery business ahead.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.player_win.1": "Oh. I wasn't slippery enough. Sorry.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.player_win.2": "I apologize for being caught.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.player_win.3": "Sorry about the mess in the bucket.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.player_win.4": "Well played. Very sorry.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.fish_win.1": "Sorry! Excuse me! Gone!",
"dialogue.belut_licin.fish_win.2": "I really am sorry about this.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.fish_win.3": "Pardon my escape.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.fish_win.4": "No hard feelings. Just slippery ones.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.reel_escape.1": "Sorry! Slipped!",
"dialogue.belut_licin.reel_escape.2": "Excuse me, I'll just be going.",
"dialogue.belut_licin.reel_escape.3": "So sorry. So slippery.",
"fish.belut_licin.subtitle": "PROFESSIONAL ESCAPEE",
"fish.belut_licin.description": "Too slippery to hold and too polite to be rude about it. Apologizes every time it gets away, which is always.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.land.1": "BREM BREM! Who's slow? You're slow!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.land.2": "Your motorcycle sounds like a cough.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.land.3": "Green light! Go go go!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.land.4": "I don't do brakes.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.player_win.1": "Pit stop. Mandatory, apparently.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.player_win.2": "Photo finish. I'm in the photo. In a bucket.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.player_win.3": "Respect. Your reflexes have nitro.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.player_win.4": "Fine. Next race, I'm bringing better fins.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.fish_win.1": "Eat my bubbles!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.fish_win.2": "Lap record. Again.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.fish_win.3": "Too slow, uncle!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.fish_win.4": "See you at the finish line. I'm already there.",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.reel_escape.1": "Gear shift! Bye!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.reel_escape.2": "Your line couldn't keep up!",
"dialogue.hampala_pembalap.reel_escape.3": "Full throttle!",
"fish.hampala_pembalap.subtitle": "UNLICENSED RACER",
"fish.hampala_pembalap.description": "Races anything that moves, mostly motorcycles on the bridge. Has opinions about Darto's motorcycle. None are kind.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.land.1": "Stand properly. Your feet are lying to you.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.land.2": "A student appears. Let us see what he knows.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.land.3": "The river taught me patience. I will teach you humility.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.land.4": "Bow first, Darto. Then fall.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.player_win.1": "Good. The student remembered the lesson.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.player_win.2": "I am beaten. Write it down. I will deny it.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.player_win.3": "Your form is ugly. It works. That is enough.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.player_win.4": "Go. Teach the bucket some manners.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.fish_win.1": "Again. Slower. With respect.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.fish_win.2": "You attacked my shadow. I was not in it.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.fish_win.3": "The river is a better student than you.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.fish_win.4": "Come back when your stance stops apologizing.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.reel_escape.1": "Force is not technique.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.reel_escape.2": "A strong pull, a weak mind.",
"dialogue.belida_pendekar.reel_escape.3": "The line broke. Your focus broke first.",
"fish.belida_pendekar.subtitle": "MASTER OF THE KENANGA STYLE",
"fish.belida_pendekar.description": "An old knife-shaped legend who teaches silat to the river's young fish. Has never lost a duel, and does not count the ones he lost.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.land.1": "This spot's got a fee. Security fee.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.land.2": "New face. New fee.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.land.3": "Pay up or square up.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.land.4": "Nobody fishes here without paying me.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.player_win.1": "Fine. First visit's free.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.player_win.2": "You'll pay for this. Literally, I hope.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.player_win.3": "Tell the bucket the fee is waived.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.player_win.4": "This is an invasive species of defeat.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.fish_win.1": "Pleasure doing business.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.fish_win.2": "Fee collected. In pride.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.fish_win.3": "Come back with exact change.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.fish_win.4": "My reservoir, my rules.",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.reel_escape.1": "Late fee!",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.reel_escape.2": "Your line didn't pay its dues!",
"dialogue.red_devil_palak.reel_escape.3": "Next time, bring cash.",
"fish.red_devil_palak.subtitle": "SELF-APPOINTED TOLL COLLECTOR",
"fish.red_devil_palak.description": "Arrived uninvited, ate everyone's lunch, and now charges a security fee for the water. Nobody has ever paid it. It keeps asking.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.land.1": "Please take a number.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.land.2": "This duel requires a stamped form.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.land.3": "Photocopy of ID, three copies, and a stamp.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.land.4": "Your application to fight me is approved. Barely.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.player_win.1": "Approved. Stamped. Defeated.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.player_win.2": "Your file has been moved to the bucket department.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.player_win.3": "Please sign here. And here. And in the bucket.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.player_win.4": "Processing complete. I hate it.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.fish_win.1": "Application rejected. Missing a stamp.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.fish_win.2": "Please come back on a working day.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.fish_win.3": "The system is down. You are also down.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.fish_win.4": "Next!",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.reel_escape.1": "Form incomplete!",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.reel_escape.2": "Your request has been forwarded. Away.",
"dialogue.patin_stempel.reel_escape.3": "Office hours are over.",
"fish.patin_stempel.subtitle": "COOPERATIVE ADMINISTRATION",
"fish.patin_stempel.description": "Runs the reservoir cooperative's paperwork with total dedication. Requires three copies of everything. Has never finished a queue.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.land.1": "Hi guys! Today we're fighting a fisherman!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.land.2": "Wait, wait, let me get my good angle.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.land.3": "Don't forget to like and subscribe!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.land.4": "This is going to be content.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.player_win.1": "Cut! Can we do that again?",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.player_win.2": "Losing gets more views anyway.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.player_win.3": "The bucket is so aesthetic though.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.player_win.4": "Link to this fisherman in the description.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.fish_win.1": "And that's a wrap, guys!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.fish_win.2": "Clip it! Clip it!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.fish_win.3": "Thanks for being in my content!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.fish_win.4": "Thirty-eight followers incoming.",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.reel_escape.1": "Plot twist!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.reel_escape.2": "Going live from the deep end!",
"dialogue.jelawat_influencer.reel_escape.3": "That's a cliffhanger, guys!",
"fish.jelawat_influencer.subtitle": "CONTENT CREATOR (37 FOLLOWERS)",
"fish.jelawat_influencer.description": "Films every duel for an audience of thirty-seven. Has asked Darto to redo his entrance twice. The lighting was bad.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.land.1": "Ugh. Do we have to?",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.land.2": "Five more minutes.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.land.3": "I'll fight you lying down. That's my style.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.land.4": "Wake me when it's over.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.player_win.1": "Fine. The bucket looks comfy anyway.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.player_win.2": "Too tired to be upset.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.player_win.3": "Carry me. Gently.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.player_win.4": "This is fine. Everything is fine. Zzz.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.fish_win.1": "That took effort. I'm going back to sleep.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.fish_win.2": "Zzz... huh? Did I win?",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.fish_win.3": "Even lazy beats tired.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.fish_win.4": "Don't wake me for the rematch.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.reel_escape.1": "Nope. Too much effort.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.reel_escape.2": "I'm out. Literally.",
"dialogue.betutu_mager.reel_escape.3": "Nap time. Bye.",
"fish.betutu_mager.subtitle": "PROFESSIONAL RESTER",
"fish.betutu_mager.description": "Expensive, rare, and deeply uninterested in moving. Bit the hook only because it was closer than the snack it wanted.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.land.1": "At ease. You will not be at ease for long.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.land.2": "My sergeant spoke of you. Unfavourably.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.land.3": "You have entered my command. Report.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.land.4": "Strategy, Darto. Not strength.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.player_win.1": "Well executed. Dismissed.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.player_win.2": "You may tell the sergeant. He will run laps.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.player_win.3": "A tactical retreat into the bucket. Noted.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.player_win.4": "You fought with discipline. I approve.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.fish_win.1": "Mission accomplished.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.fish_win.2": "Return when you have a plan.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.fish_win.3": "The deep water holds.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.fish_win.4": "Your courage is noted. Your technique is not.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.reel_escape.1": "Disengage.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.reel_escape.2": "Your line broke formation.",
"dialogue.toman_jenderal.reel_escape.3": "Withdrawal complete.",
"fish.toman_jenderal.subtitle": "COMMANDER OF THE DEEP",
"fish.toman_jenderal.description": "The giant snakehead who trained Snakehead Sergeant and regrets nothing. Runs the reservoir like a barracks. Has never once raised his voice. He never needed to.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.land.1": "Good news: I have no bones!",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.land.2": "Trust me. I'm the honest one.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.land.3": "I've never lost a fight. This is my first one.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.land.4": "I'm actually a shark.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.player_win.1": "I let you win. That's true. Probably.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.player_win.2": "Tell Bu Yati I'm boneless. She'll believe you.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.player_win.3": "I'm not even in the bucket. Look away.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.player_win.4": "Ow. That was my only bone.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.fish_win.1": "I always win. That one's true.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.fish_win.2": "I was never here.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.fish_win.3": "Bye! I'm a dolphin now.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.fish_win.4": "You lost to a boneless fish. Think about that.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.reel_escape.1": "I'm boneless! I slipped right out!",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.reel_escape.2": "That wasn't me. That was another milkfish.",
"dialogue.bandeng_tanpa_duri.reel_escape.3": "Total lie, I'm still on the hook. Bye!",
"fish.bandeng_tanpa_duri.subtitle": "CERTIFIED BONELESS (BY ITSELF)",
"fish.bandeng_tanpa_duri.description": "Claims to be boneless, which would make it the easiest fish to sell. It has more bones than anything in the estuary. Lies about everything else too.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.land.1": "Don't. Touch. My. Spikes.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.land.2": "You're making me puff. Stop it.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.land.3": "I am NOT round. This is muscle.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.land.4": "One more word and I double in size.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.player_win.1": "Hmph. I'm deflating out of spite.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.player_win.2": "Fine. But the bucket is too small for my anger.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.player_win.3": "Ugh. Now I'm round AND defeated.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.player_win.4": "Don't look at me. I'm still puffy.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.fish_win.1": "HA! Fear the sphere!",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.fish_win.2": "That's what happens when I'm upset.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.fish_win.3": "I'm still angry. Leave.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.fish_win.4": "Good. Now I can deflate in peace.",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.reel_escape.1": "TOO ROUND TO HOLD!",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.reel_escape.2": "I'm rolling away in protest!",
"dialogue.buntal_pemarah.reel_escape.3": "Don't follow me. I'm spiky.",
"fish.buntal_pemarah.subtitle": "SHORT FUSE, ROUND BODY",
"fish.buntal_pemarah.description": "Gets angry quickly and round even quicker. Insists it is not inflating. It is inflating.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.land.1": "You caught me on my warm-up lap.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.land.2": "I can walk on land. Can you swim? Didn't think so.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.land.3": "On your marks.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.land.4": "My personal best is under three seconds. Ask me what.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.player_win.1": "New personal worst. Noted.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.player_win.2": "I'll walk to the bucket myself, thanks.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.player_win.3": "Good pace. You'd do fine on mud.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.player_win.4": "I was cooling down. That's my excuse.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.fish_win.1": "Personal best!",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.fish_win.2": "See you at the finish. I've been here a while.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.fish_win.3": "Low tide, high speed.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.fish_win.4": "You run like you've got a debt.",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.reel_escape.1": "Sprint!",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.reel_escape.2": "I'm out of here! On foot!",
"dialogue.glodok_pelari.reel_escape.3": "False start! Mine!",
"fish.glodok_pelari.subtitle": "FASTEST FISH ON MUD",
"fish.glodok_pelari.description": "Runs across the mud faster than anything with fins should. Trains every low tide. Has a personal best and mentions it every time.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.land.1": "Darling, you came dressed like that?",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.land.2": "I'm due at a gathering. Make this quick.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.land.3": "Do you know who I am? No? Tragic.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.land.4": "Fighting is so last season. Fine.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.player_win.1": "Darling, the bucket is not my aesthetic.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.player_win.2": "Tell everyone I lost gracefully.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.player_win.3": "Ugh. I'll need a spa after this.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.player_win.4": "Fine. But my lawyer will hear about this.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.fish_win.1": "Kisses! Don't call me.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.fish_win.2": "That was cute. You tried.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.fish_win.3": "I'm late for brunch. Bye, darling.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.fish_win.4": "Losing suits you, darling.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.reel_escape.1": "Ciao!",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.reel_escape.2": "Your line is so cheap, darling.",
"dialogue.kakap_sosialita.reel_escape.3": "I have somewhere better to be.",
"fish.kakap_sosialita.subtitle": "ESTUARY HIGH SOCIETY",
"fish.kakap_sosialita.description": "Attends every gathering in the estuary and judges every outfit. Calls everyone darling, which is never a compliment.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.land.1": "In my day, fishermen asked permission.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.land.2": "I've seen tides older than you.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.land.3": "Careful. My spines are older than your excuses.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.land.4": "The mangroves remember me young. Barely.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.player_win.1": "Hmph. You remind me of a man who used to fish here.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.player_win.2": "Well fought, young man.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.player_win.3": "Take me. My back hurts anyway.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.player_win.4": "The estuary will gossip about this for decades.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.fish_win.1": "Kids these days.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.fish_win.2": "Come back when you've learned the tide.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.fish_win.3": "The roots hold. So do I.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.fish_win.4": "I was losing duels before you were born. Not today.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.reel_escape.1": "The tide takes me home.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.reel_escape.2": "Too eager. Like all of them.",
"dialogue.sembilang_tua.reel_escape.3": "Patience is the old way.",
"fish.sembilang_tua.subtitle": "KEEPER OF THE MANGROVE ROOTS",
"fish.sembilang_tua.description": "The oldest thing in the estuary, including the mangroves. Has complained about the young fish, the tide and the price of everything since before Darto was born.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.land.1": "I've got an order in ten minutes. Let's go.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.land.2": "On the way! I mean, here!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.land.3": "Five stars if you lose quickly.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.land.4": "I'm on the clock, uncle.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.player_win.1": "Order cancelled.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.player_win.2": "Please rate my performance.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.player_win.3": "Fine. The bucket is my last drop-off.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.player_win.4": "Rating ruined. Thanks, uncle.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.fish_win.1": "Delivered!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.fish_win.2": "Five stars for me!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.fish_win.3": "Gotta go, next order!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.fish_win.4": "Tip's optional. Losing isn't.",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.reel_escape.1": "Running late!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.reel_escape.2": "Shortcut through the deep!",
"dialogue.tongkol_ojol.reel_escape.3": "Next order's waiting!",
"fish.tongkol_ojol.subtitle": "ALWAYS ON THE WAY",
"fish.tongkol_ojol.description": "Always delivering something somewhere in a hurry. Has a five-star rating and an extremely tight schedule. Will fight you between orders.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.land.1": "O fisherman, thou hast hooked a poet.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.land.2": "The moon weeps. So shall you.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.land.3": "Behold my silver. Then despair.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.land.4": "Every duel is a poem. This one is a tragedy.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.player_win.1": "A sad ending. My favourite kind.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.player_win.2": "The bucket. How tragically humble.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.player_win.3": "Write this down. Make it rhyme.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.player_win.4": "I fall, like the evening tide.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.fish_win.1": "And so, the poet swims away.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.fish_win.2": "Thy loss is my stanza.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.fish_win.3": "The sea applauds. Quietly.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.fish_win.4": "Fin.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.reel_escape.1": "The line, like love, has broken.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.reel_escape.2": "I return to the dark water.",
"dialogue.layur_penyair.reel_escape.3": "Farewell, fisherman of little rhyme.",
"fish.layur_penyair.subtitle": "POET OF THE NIGHT TIDE",
"fish.layur_penyair.description": "Long, silver and dramatic about everything. Recites poems about the moon, the sea and its own reflection. Mostly its reflection.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.land.1": "Need cash fast? I can help. Sign here.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.land.2": "Low interest. Lower morals.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.land.3": "Your debt's slow. I could make it fast.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.land.4": "Everyone pays me eventually.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.player_win.1": "You'll be back. They always come back.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.player_win.2": "Fine. The bucket doesn't charge interest.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.player_win.3": "Shortcuts were the easy part, huh?",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.player_win.4": "Respect. You read the fine print.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.fish_win.1": "Interest accrued.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.fish_win.2": "Pay me back in pride.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.fish_win.3": "My offer still stands. Forever.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.fish_win.4": "Fast cash, slow fisherman.",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.reel_escape.1": "Late payment!",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.reel_escape.2": "Your line defaulted!",
"dialogue.barakuda_rentenir.reel_escape.3": "I'll collect later.",
"fish.barakuda_rentenir.subtitle": "FAST CASH, FASTER TEETH",
"fish.barakuda_rentenir.description": "Offers instant loans to anyone who looks tired. Describes the interest as flexible. Darto has said no every single time.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.land.1": "You know who owns this pier? Me. Partly.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.land.2": "I'll pay you to throw me back. No? Fine.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.land.3": "Business first. Then violence.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.land.4": "My boats are watching.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.player_win.1": "Good deal. For you.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.player_win.2": "Tell Bu Yati I want a fair price.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.player_win.3": "Fine. I'll buy the bucket later.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.player_win.4": "You drive a hard bargain, fisherman.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.fish_win.1": "Deal closed.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.fish_win.2": "Nobody beats a tycoon on his own pier.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.fish_win.3": "Come work for me. Starting pay: no.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.fish_win.4": "My crew will hear about this. Loudly.",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.reel_escape.1": "I'm buying my freedom!",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.reel_escape.2": "Back to the boats!",
"dialogue.kerapu_juragan.reel_escape.3": "Your line was underpriced.",
"fish.kerapu_juragan.subtitle": "OWNER OF THREE BOATS (ALLEGEDLY)",
"fish.kerapu_juragan.description": "Owns three boats, a warehouse and a very loud voice. Made the auctioneer at the fish market faint by negotiating its own price. Got a good price.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.land.1": "The sea tells stories about you, Darto.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.land.2": "You came a long way from that little lake.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.land.3": "Raise your sail. The wind is fair.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.land.4": "Only the patient reach the open sea.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.player_win.1": "Well sailed, fisherman.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.player_win.2": "The sea will remember this tide.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.player_win.3": "Go home. Your family is waiting.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.player_win.4": "You did not take the shortcut. Good.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.fish_win.1": "The sea is wide. Try again.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.fish_win.2": "Not yet, Darto. But soon.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.fish_win.3": "A good captain knows when to turn back.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.fish_win.4": "The tide will bring you back.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.reel_escape.1": "The open sea calls.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.reel_escape.2": "Hold the line, not the anger.",
"dialogue.layaran_kapten.reel_escape.3": "Farewell, for now.",
"fish.layaran_kapten.subtitle": "LEGEND OF THE OPEN SEA",
"fish.layaran_kapten.description": "The fastest thing in the sea and the oldest story on the pier. Sailors say whoever beats him will never need a shortcut again. Sailors say a lot of things.",
"location.cempaka.name": "Cempaka Lake",
"location.cempaka.trait": "Calm water. Where it all started.",
"location.kenanga.name": "Kenanga River",
"location.kenanga.trait": "Strong current: the reel marker keeps sinking.",
"location.kenanga.gear": "Current Hook",
"location.kenanga.gear_desc": "A heavy hook that holds in fast water. Opens Kenanga River.",
"location.melati.name": "Melati Reservoir",
"location.melati.trait": "Deep water: longer waits, bigger fish.",
"location.melati.gear": "Long Line",
"location.melati.gear_desc": "Reaches the deep water. Opens Melati Reservoir.",
"location.anggrek.name": "Anggrek Estuary",
"location.anggrek.trait": "Tides: high water brings fish, low water brings trash.",
"location.anggrek.gear": "Mud Boots",
"location.anggrek.gear_desc": "Keeps you upright in the estuary mud. Opens Anggrek Estuary.",
"location.mawar.name": "Mawar Pier",
"location.mawar.trait": "Waves: the line strains as each wave rolls in.",
"location.mawar.gear": "Sea Rod",
"location.mawar.gear_desc": "Strong enough for sea fish and salt water. Opens Mawar Pier.",
"arrival.kenanga.1": "Kenanga River. The current's strong today.",
"arrival.kenanga.2": "There's the buyer on the bridge. Crooked scale, big smile.",
"arrival.kenanga.3": "No thanks. Everything goes to Bu Yati.",
"arrival.melati.1": "Melati Reservoir. Nisa's school is somewhere over there.",
"arrival.melati.2": "The cooperative office has a queue. On a Sunday.",
"arrival.melati.3": "I'll just fish. The forms can wait forever.",
"arrival.anggrek.1": "Anggrek Estuary. It smells like salt and mud.",
"arrival.anggrek.2": "Rini's father walked this mud with a crab basket.",
"arrival.anggrek.3": "High tide, low tide. I'll keep an eye on it.",
"arrival.mawar.1": "Mawar Pier. That's the sea. All of it.",
"arrival.mawar.2": "The auction is over there. The auctioneer still looks pale.",
"arrival.mawar.3": "Wherever the fish come from, they go to Bu Yati.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.01": "The man with the white van called again.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.02": "More catfish?",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.03": "Baung. River fish. Your lake doesn't have any.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.04": "There's a river past the old bridge.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.05": "Kenanga. The current is strong. Buy a current hook.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.06": "From you, I assume.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.07": "From me. And you sell the fish to me.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.08": "There's a buyer right on the bridge.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.09": "The one with the crooked scale? Go ahead. Lose half.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.10": "...I'll sell to you.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.11": "Good. Fish from anywhere ends up here.",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.12": "NEW SPOT: KENANGA RIVER",
"story.story_unlock_kenanga.13": "Buy the Current Hook at the Market, then tap the map at the water.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.01": "Dad, there's a reservoir near my school.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.02": "Is there?",
"story.story_unlock_melati.03": "The kids say a red devil fish lives there. It's mean.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.04": "I've met mean fish. I'm a professional now.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.05": "If you go, wave at my school.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.06": "Melati Reservoir? You need a long line. The water is deep.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.07": "There's a fishing cooperative there.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.08": "Members only. Three photocopies and two weeks.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.09": "And you?",
"story.story_unlock_melati.10": "I ask one question.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.11": "Fish fresh?",
"story.story_unlock_melati.12": "See. You know the procedure.",
"story.story_unlock_melati.13": "NEW SPOT: MELATI RESERVOIR",
"story.story_unlock_melati.14": "Buy the Long Line at the Market. The water is deep and the fish are heavy.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.01": "Bu Yati says you're going to the estuary.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.02": "News travels fast.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.03": "My father used to look for crabs there.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.04": "I didn't know that.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.05": "He always brought them to the same shop.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.06": "Bu Yati's?",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.07": "Her mother's, back then. Wear boots. It's muddy.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.08": "Your father-in-law sold us crabs for twenty years.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.09": "Twenty years at the same shop?",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.10": "We never cheated his scale. He never sold anywhere else.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.11": "So that's why everything ends up here.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.12": "The boots are on the shelf.",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.13": "NEW SPOT: ANGGREK ESTUARY",
"story.story_unlock_anggrek.14": "Buy the Mud Boots at the Market. Watch the tide: high water brings fish.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.01": "Regular supply. The man with the van agreed.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.02": "So I have a job.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.03": "You have a contract. There's a wedding next month. He wants sea fish.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.04": "The pier at Mawar? That's far.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.05": "Your motorcycle has been further. Probably.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.06": "There's a fish auction at the pier.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.07": "For boat owners. And the auctioneer faints when the fish talk back.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.08": "Mine always talk back.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.09": "I know. That's why you sell them to me.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.10": "You're the only one who doesn't mind.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.11": "I mind. I just don't faint. Buy a sea rod.",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.12": "NEW SPOT: MAWAR PIER",
"story.story_unlock_mawar.13": "Buy the Sea Rod at the Market. Hold on when the waves roll in.",
"duel.silat": "Silat",
"duel.tambang": "Tug of War",
"duel.gasing": "Spinning Tops",
"duel.pinang": "Greased Pole",
"duel.silat.upper": "SILAT",
"duel.tambang.upper": "TUG OF WAR",
"duel.gasing.upper": "SPINNING TOPS",
"duel.pinang.upper": "GREASED POLE",
"howto.tab.silat": "SILAT",
"howto.tab.tambang": "TUG OF WAR",
"howto.tab.gasing": "SPINNING TOPS",
"howto.tab.pinang": "GREASED POLE",
"howto.tab.travel": "TRAVEL",
"howto.body.silat": "The fish shows a sequence of moves.\nRepeat it in the same order with the four arrows.\nGet it right and you land a counter.\nA wrong move or running out of time gets you hit.\nThree counters win the duel.",
"howto.body.tambang": "A marker swings across the bar.\nTap PULL when it is inside the green zone.\nPulling outside it makes you slip.\nThe fish pulls the whole time.\nDrag the rope past your line to win.",
"howto.body.gasing": "Tap once to aim and once to set the power.\nA straight, strong throw spins longest.\nWhen the tops clash, tap as the ring closes.\nA well-timed tap hits harder.\nThe last top spinning wins.",
"howto.body.pinang": "Tap LEFT and RIGHT in turn to climb.\nThe same side twice makes you slip.\nTapping too fast makes the pole greasy.\nKeep a steady rhythm.\nFirst to the top wins.",
"howto.body.travel": "New spots open as you pay off the debt.\nBuy each spot's gear at the Market, then tap the map at the water.\nEvery spot has its own fish and its own duel.\nYou always sell at the Market.",
"silat.intro.subtitle": "SILAT. THREE COUNTERS.",
"tambang.intro.subtitle": "TUG OF WAR",
"gasing.intro.subtitle": "SPINNING TOPS",
"pinang.intro.subtitle": "GREASED POLE. FIRST TO THE TOP.",
"silat.tutorial": "WATCH THE MOVES, THEN REPEAT THEM",
"tambang.tutorial": "TAP PULL INSIDE THE GREEN ZONE",
"gasing.tutorial": "TAP TO AIM, TAP AGAIN FOR POWER",
"pinang.tutorial": "LEFT, RIGHT, LEFT, RIGHT. STEADY.",
